  "body": "Ubuntu 24.04 / GCC 13 release build.\n\nAll packages include lavik, lavik-meta, lavik-ctl, Lavik Admin,\nits Node.js runtime, LICENSE and notices. Run ./lavik-admin and open\nhttp://localhost:4173 to deploy and manage clusters over SSH.\n- Standard: DPDK/SPDK included; x86-64-v2 or ARMv8-A+CRC32 required.\n- Minimal: kernel TCP/io_uring only; compiler-default CPU target.\n\nBoth variants require Linux 6.1+ with io_uring enabled for lavik and\nlavik-meta, including DPDK/SPDK deployments, and Ubuntu 24.04-compatible glibc.\n\nSource: [2908f86f2770e9c6e8acc6585b3bedb4b44d1cd5](https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/commit/2908f86f2770e9c6e8acc6585b3bedb4b44d1cd5)\n\n[Hardware and platform requirements](https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/blob/2908f86f2770e9c6e8acc6585b3bedb4b44d1cd5/README.md#release-hardware-and-platform-requirements)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* Fix managed FLUSH recovery test and bump version to 0.1.1 by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/322\n* docs(perf): replace Aerospike YCSB report with v0.1.0 measurements by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/324\n* docs(perf): add 2-vCPU Redis/Valkey comparison and Lavik 100M-key benchmark by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/325\n* docs: omit default parameters from test reports by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/326\n* docs(perf): benchmark Lavik v0.1.0 against Redis and Valkey by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/323\n* docs(perf): use throughput lines and simplify chart annotations by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/327\n* docs: unify and compact README benchmark charts by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/328\n* docs: prioritize benchmarks and release installation in README by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/329\n* refactor(meta): share command decoding envelope by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/330\n* fix(meta): preserve accepted Admin mutation results by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/331\n* docs: replace storage comparisons with 1TB benchmark report by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/333\n* refactor(meta): remove unused GroupRecord codec by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/332\n* fix(replication): support wide argument counts with V2 encoding by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/334\n* test(storage): release collection write pauses explicitly by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/336\n* refactor(meta): centralize operation state predicates by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/335\n* fix(replication): preserve admitted writes under memory pressure by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/337\n* Fix grouped List prepend fragmentation and String directory rebuilds by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/338\n* perf(storage): release worker store state during grouped String and Stream preparation by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/340\n* feat(storage): make record CRC opt-in with persistent flags by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/341\n* perf(redis): reduce large String receive and segment copies by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/339\n* test: fix main CI CRC and blocking waiter order failures by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/345\n* Avoid redundant work in grouped ZSET point writes by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/344\n* Reuse neighboring ZSET page capacity before splitting by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/343\n* perf(storage): decouple Tx cleanup from writes and batch flushes by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/346\n* perf(storage): remove intermediate grouped String copies by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/347\n* Adopt queued io_uring and SPDK submissions by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/348\n* perf(storage): parallelize grouped reads per physical owner by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/349\n* perf: avoid full Hash/Set decoding on reads and splice compact Hash writes by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/342\n* perf: pack collection read replies into owned byte blocks by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/350\n* Simplify command dispatch and fix GCC coroutine test compilation by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/352\n* perf: batch collection RESP replies and inline point operands by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/351\n* perf: simplify fixed-width endian decoding by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/353\n* refactor: simplify connection moves and replication prefix checks by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/354\n* perf: reuse dense sorted-set pages during point mutations by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/356\n* build: pin Bycorf Connection receive control layout by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/317\n* perf: reduce allocation and copying in compact point writes by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/357\n* perf: streamline grouped sorted-set validation and point insertion by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/358\n* perf: edit grouped ZSet pages without per-member allocations by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/359\n* refactor: give encoded ZSet pages a dedicated loader by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/360\n* test: preserve Stream concurrency failure logs by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/361\n* test: wait for replica readability in native handoff gate by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/362\n* test: tolerate closed sockets in lease policy proxy by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/364\n* fix: refresh Stream range locations before pinning by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/365\n* perf: reduce ScanHashMap entry span allocation overhead by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/366\n* Default to immediate online mimalloc purging by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/367\n* chore: bump version to 0.2.0 by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/368\n* chore: pin bycorf to latest main by @thweetkomputer in https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/pull/369\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/eloqdata/lavik/compare/v0.1.0...v0.2.0",
